      "result_description": "Bersham CC - 1st XI - Conceded",
      "result_applied_to": "20551",
      "match_notes": "<p>Covid&nbsp;outbreak&nbsp;for&nbsp;Bersham,&nbsp;called&nbsp;this&nbsp;morning&nbsp;and&nbsp;unable&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;7&nbsp;players&nbsp;-&nbsp;couldn&rsquo;t&nbsp;find&nbsp;result&nbsp;entry&nbsp;which&nbsp;didn&rsquo;t&nbsp;penalise&nbsp;them&nbsp;with&nbsp;-15</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cancellation&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mochdre&nbsp;v&nbsp;Bersham&nbsp;CC</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On&nbsp;31&nbsp;Jul&nbsp;2021&nbsp;09:35,&nbsp;Phil&nbsp;Young&nbsp;&lt;<a href=\"mailto:turnonasixpence@googlemail.com\" target=\"_blank\">turnonasixpence@googlemail.com</a>&gt;&nbsp;wrote:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hi&nbsp;-&nbsp;I&#39;m&nbsp;sorry&nbsp;about&nbsp;this,&nbsp;but&nbsp;a&nbsp;couple&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;lads&nbsp;tested&nbsp;positive&nbsp;for&nbsp;covid&nbsp;earlier&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;week&nbsp;and&nbsp;others&nbsp;who&nbsp;associate&nbsp;with&nbsp;them&nbsp;have&nbsp;been&nbsp;similarly&nbsp;impacted.&nbsp;As&nbsp;such,&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;had&nbsp;to&nbsp;call&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;off.&nbsp;I&nbsp;have&nbsp;left&nbsp;a&nbsp;message&nbsp;with&nbsp;Sean&nbsp;McHale,&nbsp;the&nbsp;second&nbsp;team&nbsp;skipper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To:&nbsp;Phil&nbsp;Young&nbsp;&lt;<a href=\"mailto:turnonasixpence@googlemail.com\">turnonasixpence@googlemail.com</a>&gt;<br />\r\nCc:&nbsp;Margaret&nbsp;Smith&nbsp;&lt;<a href=\"mailto:maggie69rhosfadog@gmail.com\">maggie69rhosfadog@gmail.com</a>&gt;,&nbsp;Andrew&nbsp;Tilley&nbsp;&lt;<a href=\"mailto:ATilley@unifrax.com\">ATilley@unifrax.com</a>&gt;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Phil</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks&nbsp;for&nbsp;letting&nbsp;us&nbsp;know&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;importantly&nbsp;I&nbsp;hope&nbsp;your&nbsp;players&nbsp;are&nbsp;ok&nbsp;and&nbsp;can&nbsp;return&nbsp;for&nbsp;next&nbsp;weeks&nbsp;game.&nbsp;&nbsp;As&nbsp;this&nbsp;game&nbsp;has&nbsp;had&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;called&nbsp;off&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;covid&nbsp;you&nbsp;wont&nbsp;be&nbsp;deducted&nbsp;minus&nbsp;15&nbsp;points&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;receive&nbsp;0&nbsp;points&nbsp;and&nbsp;mochdre&nbsp;will&nbsp;receive&nbsp;the&nbsp;average&nbsp;points&nbsp;scored&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;teams&nbsp;winning&nbsp;in&nbsp;division&nbsp;2&nbsp;today.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Take&nbsp;care&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Andy&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
